<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italian BTP bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italian BTP bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a 13th tranche of 1.5 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying an 8.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   July 1, 2006    previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	  7.30 pct vs   7.84 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield	8.42 pct vs   8.99 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price 103.20     vs  99.60</p>
<p> Bids		 2.33 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   1.50 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The comparisons are with a previous auction on Sept 16 of an 11th tranche of 10-year BTPs.</p>
</text>
